   "en": "The god writer she admires is the grandson of her late otaku friend!\nHami, a nerdy college student, is forced to live alone after her sister gets transferred to a new job. Then, Hami's follower \"Sakurako\" passes away!\nHami receives a dreamy mansion filled with otaku goods from her otaku friend and the chairman of a large company in her will, and she will be living with her three grandchildren...!\n\nThe life of an otaku girl and her three brothers is about to begin!"
